Protocols and algorithms
------------------------

The ESPHome native API and its Noise encryption (Noise_NNpsk0_25519_ChaChaPoly_SHA256) are implemented from their
public descriptions. X25519 follows TweetNaCl (public domain) and RFC 7748; ChaCha20-Poly1305 follows RFC 8439, with
Poly1305 after poly1305-donna (public domain).

